<title>JAPAN: Toyota buys five percent in Zenrin.</title>
<headline>Toyota buys five percent in Zenrin.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-06-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Toyota Motor Corp said on Friday that it had bought 1.68 million shares, or five percent, of mapmaker Zenrin Co Ltd.  </p>
<p>The transaction took place on Friday, Toyota said in a statement.</p>
<p>Toyota said the decision to buy shares in Zenrin was made in the hope of developing software for better car navigation systems.</p>
</text>
